{"speciesId":833,"names":{"fr":"Khélocrok","es":"Chewtle","en":"Chewtle","ja":"カムカメ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il a pour habitude de mordre tout ce qui lui passe sous les yeux. On raconte qu’il fait cela parce que ses incisives qui poussent le démangent."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Muerde todo lo que se le ponga por delante. Al parecer, lo hace para aliviar el dolor que siente cuando le crecen los incisivos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Apparently the itch of its teething impels it to snap its jaws at anything in front of it."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"目の前の ものに すぐに 噛みつく 習性。 生えかけの 前歯が 痒いので 噛みついてしまうらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La corne sur sa tête est aussi dure que la roche. Il s’en sert pour se battre et lorsque l’ennemi flanche, il le mord et ne le lâche plus."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El cuerno que tiene en la cabeza es duro como una roca. Lo usa para atacar al rival y, cuando este baja la guardia, lo muerde y no lo suelta."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It starts off battles by attacking with its rock-hard horn, but as soon as the opponent flinches, this Pokémon bites down and never lets go."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"頭の ツノは 岩の 硬さ。 ツノで 戦い ひるんだ 隙に パクリと 噛みつき 離さない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":833,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[20,"level-up",21],[25,"level-up",21]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",49],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",49],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[20,"level-up",7],[25,"level-up",7]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"counter","learns":[[20,"level-up",28],[25,"level-up",28]]},{"name